["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Peter Galison &amp; Sophie Ritson on Imaging the Invisible clean Bayesian / forward methods mechanical objectivity tacit knowledge photon ring\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-11-thehpspodcastc-黑洞照片不是拍出来的-是四个互不通气的团队算出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/588cad575b4d6366-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The HPS Podcast - Conversations from History, Philosophy and Social Studies of Science</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞照片不是拍出來的，是四個互不通氣的團隊算出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2019 年那張 M87 黑洞照片，四個圖像團隊被隔離作業、互相欺騙，用 Frosty the Snowman 當測試圖，只為證明他們沒把想看到的東西算進數據裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科學哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞成像</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Did Numerical Control De-skill Machinists? Numerical Control (NC) CNC journeyman agentic\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-asianometry-数控机床没让技工降级-平均技能水平几乎没变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0a71dde8bc0fbd1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>數控機床沒讓技工降級，平均技能水平幾乎沒變</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從 1950 年代起，人們就擔心數控會讓機加工技工去技能化。但 A 級技工和 NC 操作工的時薪幾乎持平，三十年裡整體技能水平只降了約 1%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動化</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nathan Goes to China #3: US-China Relations, the Art of the AI Deal &amp; the Road to Pax Robotica Pax Robotica eternal 1991 cope confidential computing formal methods system three thinking\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-cogrev-出口管制的理由一路退守-只剩一个前提说得通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b0be259c3ffba6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:17:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>出口管制的理由一路退守，只剩一個前提說得通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最初是防軍事用途，後來退成阻止前沿模型，再退成限制中國能跑多少 AI agent；這套政策唯一自洽的前提，是相信短期衝刺神級超級智能、誰先到誰通吃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"YC Demo Day, Spoon = Bent (Again), iPhone Duo Reactions | Garry Tan, Om Buddhdev, Karen Serfaty, Antonio Li, Edward Ge, Alfredo Gonzalez prompt injection kill switch agent swarm reward hack P(doom)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-tbpn-有人拿-1000-万美元赌-ai-不会在-2030-年前灭绝人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5c9897d5e90ae69-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>有人拿 1000 萬美元賭 AI 不會在 2030 年前滅絕人類</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把「P(doom)」這種沒法證偽的數字，換成有截止日期、能結算的命題，是這集最好用的一招：末日概率好傳播，有用的卻是能逐條追蹤、能逐條推翻的事件鏈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">數據標註</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Psychoactive substances helped spur Andean civilization, and breaking barriers to education structured pedagogy teaching at the right level implementation science learning poverty iawasa\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-sciencepod-致幻植物塑造了安第斯文明-而不只是印加人的啤酒/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de66276d50c998a0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>致幻植物塑造了安第斯文明，而不只是印加人的啤酒</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">考古學家在秘魯和玻利維亞的骨管、鼻吸托盤和陶杯裡驗出了 DMT 與維拉，說明致幻藥物曾是前印加複雜社會共有的信仰基礎設施——而印加人轉向了喝奇恰啤酒。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">致幻劑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Hydrodynamic and dusty instabilities in planet formation - Min-Kai Lin VSI (vertical shear instability) COS (convective overstability) streaming instability zonal flow Stokes number resonant drag instability\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-instituteforad-行星形成靠的是尘埃自己塌缩-不是气体湍流/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a390bde2cd3d09c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>行星形成靠的是塵埃自己塌縮，不是氣體湍流</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">VSI 和 COS 這類純流體不穩定性把塵埃攪回大氣層，造不出星子；只有讓塵埃主動反饋、甚至讓氣體吸積，才能把塵埃壓到塌縮密度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行星形成</span><span class=\"tag\">原行星盤</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"One resignation turned the embers of AI fear into a wildfire RSI Lossy self-improvement Fast Takeoff\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-interconnects-一次辞职点燃了-ai-恐慌-但恐慌的剧本是错的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/117435d411031fe3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">10:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>一次辭職點燃了 AI 恐慌，但恐慌的劇本是錯的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 風險討論被一次辭職推到了極端，但真正該擔心的不是滅絕，而是實驗室連自己的基礎設施都沒加固。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開放模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why the intelligence explosion can&#x27;t happen inside a data centre | Tom Reed sample efficiency Goodhart Singularity jaggedness continual learning RL environments\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-eightythousand-数据中心里造不出超级智能-瓶颈是真实世界的信号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd24910e04834e0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>數據中心裡造不出超級智能：瓶頸是真實世界的信號</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 研發自動化不等於超級智能：Tom Reed 認為多數任務的數據只能在真實市場裡部署模型才產生，樣本效率和模擬都補不上，奇點卡在信號而非算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI 時間線</span><span class=\"tag\">數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Nilanjan Das on Buddhist Philosophy and Caste varnas jatis universals epistemic seeing eliminativism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-phibites-婆罗门身份不是狗性-一位佛教哲学家如何拆掉种姓的形而上学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/243c92b44ec40dbb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">20:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophy Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>婆羅門身份不是狗性：一位佛教哲學家如何拆掉種姓的形而上學</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法稱不否認狗有「狗性」這種共相，卻拒絕承認存在「婆羅門性」——因為婆羅門與首陀羅在身體、智力、能力上沒有任何可感知的差別，種姓不產生任何因果效力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">印度哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">佛教</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The First Space Elevator: Where Would We Build It? Earthport skyhook Lagrange points geostationary orbit mass driver\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-isaacarthur-第一座太空电梯不该建在陆地-而该建在赤道太平洋的船上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d168afeb223cb246-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">22:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>第一座太空電梯不該建在陸地，而該建在赤道太平洋的船上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">第一座太空電梯選址的核心不是離城市近，而是讓失敗後果最小：赤道太平洋的移動海上平臺，天氣溫和、遠離航線、出事只掉進公海。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空電梯</span><span class=\"tag\">軌道運輸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Lotus Eaters Episode 7: Lying Odysseus [unlocked] xenia theodicy liminal\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-verybad-奥德修斯回到伊萨卡却不敢认自己-他撒谎是在躲什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5c06d20471805861-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">55:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>奧德修斯回到伊薩卡卻不敢認自己：他撒謊是在躲什麼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他明明已經踏上故鄉，卻先編造一個克里特人的身份，連對最忠誠的豬倌也不肯說真話——因為真正的問題不是能不能回家，而是他還能不能認出自己。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">荷馬</span><span class=\"tag\">奧德賽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"When AI Improves Itself | Richard Socher (Recursive) recursive self-improvement next-token prediction Jevons paradox virtual cell open-endedness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-madpod-ai-自我改进的瓶颈不是算力-是模拟与验证/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90800bca4b008abf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">MAD Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>AI 自我改進的瓶頸不是算力，是模擬與驗證</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">凡是能被模擬的領域，AI 終將解決；凡是無法模擬的領域，再強的模型也只能等實驗數據。Richard Socher 認為遞歸自我改進的路徑是先讓 AI 研究 AI，再攻生物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">遞歸自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI Is Rewriting the Power Law of Venture Capital power law death of the middle TPPI vintage ARR LBO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-a16z-ai-让风投的幂律变得更极端-而不是更温和/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓風投的冪律變得更極端，而不是更溫和</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">3000 家風投裡只有 20 家連續二十年做到 3 倍淨回報。AI 第一次讓錢能直接換成算力、算力直接變成產品優勢，冪律因此更陡，而非更平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 配置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Coinbase’s Everything Exchange: Agentic Finance, Stablecoins, and Tokenization with CEO Brian Armstrong Everything Exchange X402 agentic finance epigenetic reprogramming\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-nopriors-给-ai-代理开户-信用卡手续费撑不起机器经济/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f9f8b9697bf1eed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>給 AI 代理開戶：信用卡手續費撐不起機器經濟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coinbase 想讓每個 AI 代理都有自己的賬戶：76% 的機器支付在 30 美分以下，而信用卡的最低手續費恰好就是 30 美分——舊支付軌道撐不起機器經濟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加密支付</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 代理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Finances of Marriage | Rational Reminder 426 tight wad spendthrift unconflicted consumer financial infidelity prenup\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-rationalreminder-结婚前先做花钱测试-紧手和挥霍者互相吸引-也更容易离婚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad3115003cac32ae-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>結婚前先做花錢測試：緊手和揮霍者互相吸引，也更容易離婚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究把花錢的人分成緊手和揮霍者，兩端的人更容易互相吸引，但婚後金錢衝突更多、婚姻滿意度更低；婚禮花得越多，離婚風險反而越高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人財務</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Finances of Marriage | #426 tightwad spendthrift anticipatory pain of paying financial infidelity unconflicted consumer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-rationalreminder-婚礼花得越多离婚率越高-最省的那批人反而最稳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>婚禮花得越多離婚率越高，最省的那批人反而最穩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究顯示婚禮花費越低離婚率越低，低於一千美元的那批人離婚率最低；而訂婚戒指花得越多，男性離婚風險越高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">婚姻財務</span><span class=\"tag\">消費心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Predatory Industry Behind MLB’s Dominican Superstar Pipeline early agreement international draft signing bonus Dominican Summer League\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-papertrail-mlb-在多米尼加建了棒球城堡-也养出了放贷人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed1b4a79f40f86fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>MLB 在多米尼加建了棒球城堡，也養出了放貸人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">MLB 每年在多米尼加投入高達 4 億美元，卻沒有選秀、允許 16 歲前私下籤約，於是催生了一個向球員家庭放高利貸的影子產業，而 David Ortiz 被指是其中一環。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育產業</span><span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Where Have The Insects Gone?? With Dr. Jessica Ware colony collapse disorder Varroa mite neonicotinoid pollinator garden oothika spiracles\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-sciencevs-昆虫正在消失-但杀虫剂不是最大凶手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/632ea71d96602758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>昆蟲正在消失，但殺蟲劑不是最大凶手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">昆蟲數量下降被反覆質疑誇大，但全球數據仍在指向同一方向；真正被低估的兇手不是農業，而是普通人隨手買來用的殺蟲劑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生態</span><span class=\"tag\">昆蟲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E909.我們給殘障人寫「爽文」戲劇，把健全人寫成弱勢群體 原罪人 鏡面人 口述影像\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-cn907a40-残障剧团让健全人当被歧视的少数-不是要你同情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b8c6d4c5deab1aa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">41:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>殘障劇團讓健全人當被歧視的少數，不是要你同情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">妖妖把社會關係整個調轉過來：核戰後多數人成了改造人，少數沒改造的健全人成了原罪人，要爭取權利的反倒是他們。這不是訴苦，是給殘障人寫的爽文。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">殘障</span><span class=\"tag\">戲劇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Archive: Plato&#x27;s Republic Thrasymachus the Forms the cave the ring of Gyges tripartite soul demagogue\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-inourtime-柏拉图理想国-民主离暴政只差一个煽动家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b92ca842f2a04535-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">50:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>柏拉圖理想國：民主離暴政只差一個煽動家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柏拉圖認為民主制內部就埋著滑向暴政的通道，被野心家利用只是時間問題；而正義不是外在行為，是靈魂內部的秩序。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">政治哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Essentials: Genes &amp; the Inheritance of Memories Across Generations | Dr. Oded Rechavi Weismann barrier C. elegans small RNAs RNA interference epigenetic reprogramming\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-huberman-获得性遗传在线虫已被证实-人类还没有证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8f8083a6d5296169-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">35:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>獲得性遺傳在線蟲已被證實，人類還沒有證據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">教科書用魏斯曼屏障解釋為什麼練出的肌肉傳不下去；但在線蟲裡，敲掉後代自己造小 RNA 的能力，它們仍能抵抗父母遇過的病毒，只改大腦裡的 RNA 就能改變三代後的行為。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">表觀遺傳</span><span class=\"tag\">線蟲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Robert A. Wilson, &quot;Kin Matters: Relational Beings in the Fragile Sciences&quot; (Oxford UP, 2026) progenerative view Westermark hypothesis separatism extended cognition homeostatic property cluster disciplinary groove\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-nbphilosophy-亲属关系不是文化发明-而是生殖事实的文化延展/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1c8789e8a81bb90f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">New Books in Philosophy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>親屬關係不是文化發明，而是生殖事實的文化延展</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人類學家說親屬關係純屬文化建構，哲學家卻指出：女性先懷孕後生育這類生殖事實跨文化通用，親屬制度是對它們的文化延展，連亂倫迴避也不是人類獨有。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人類學</span><span class=\"tag\">親屬關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of Organized Retail Crime at Big Box Stores shrink ORC (organized retail crime) boosters fence INFORM Act edge analytics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-oddlots-偷来的货能卖到原价七八折-零售盗窃已经产业化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>偷來的貨能賣到原價七八折，零售盜竊已經產業化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被盜商品要經過兩層手：boosters 被招募進店偷貨，fence 負責清洗標識和轉售，之後掛上二手平臺。聯網的贓物能賣到原價七八折，T 恤和除臭劑只剩三成多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售損耗</span><span class=\"tag\">有組織零售犯罪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How baseball got its beat walk-up song seventh inning stretch Tin Pan Alley closer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-10-throughline-棒球场的音乐不是伴奏-是球迷抢回比赛的方式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f35a52e32ee13fa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">32:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>棒球場的音樂不是伴奏，是球迷搶回比賽的方式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">棒球官方史學家嫌球場音樂太吵，但正是球迷齊唱 Hey Hey Goodbye 把客隊投手唱到手軟——音樂讓觀眾從看客變成比賽的一部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">棒球</span><span class=\"tag\">現場體驗</span>\n</div></div></a>"]